# What a member checks out must be byte-for-byte what was shipped.
#
# git converts line endings on checkout when core.autocrlf is on, which it is on this
# machine and on most Windows machines. That silently changes every text file between
# the copy that was verified and the copy that lands, so a checksum can never confirm
# a member has the real instrument. These files are delivered exactly as committed.
* -text
